{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-10-22 13:24:00', 'title': 'ORACLE NAMED A LEADER IN THE GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR CLOUD HCM SUITES FOR 1,000+ EMPLOYEE ENTERPRISES', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS, OCT. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED A LEADER FOR THE SIXTH SUCCESSIVE YEAR IN THE 2021 GARTNER® MAGIC QUADRANT™\xa0FOR CLOUD HCM SUITES FOR 1,000+ EMPLOYEE ENTERPRISES FOR ORACLE FUSION CLOUD HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM). THE REPORT EVALUATES VENDORS BASED ON ABILITY TO EXECUTE AND COMPLETENESS OF VISION.'}